@host = http://localhost:5000

### A valid identity number (masked in the response)
GET {{host}}/people/10000000146

### An invalid identity number: 400
GET {{host}}/people/10000000147

### A province and its districts
GET {{host}}/provinces/istanbul

### A Turkish amount
GET {{host}}/amounts?text=₺1.234,56

### Upload a file
POST {{host}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./photo.png
--boundary--
